'''Dwarven O's Ore Oats''' are an {{Uncommon}} [[Consumable]]. It is obtained by completing [[Dwarven Mines#Major Events|Mining Events]] in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Obtaining ==
'''Dwarven O's Ore Oats''' have a chance to drop when participating in [[Dwarven Mines#Major Events|Mining Events]] in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Usage ==
'''Dwarven O's Ore Oats''' can be consumed up to {{Green|5}} times. Each '''Dwarven O's Ore Oats''' eaten permanently increases the player's {{Stat|of}} by {{Stat|of|+2|icononly=yes}}, up to {{Stat|of|+10}}.

